1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,500
Now, I'd like to go to an Akanta Idol main project like that. 

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,000
I'm sorry to ask you to do this too, Mr. Usuki.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Can I ask this to Cute?

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
I understand. Leave it to me.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,000
I'll go!

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,500
My three elements!

7
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:18,500
Yay!

8
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,500
You're as cute as you can be!

9
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,500
Yes, as much as I can.

10
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,000
Thank you!

11
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,500
I have chosen!

12
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:29,500
Now then, may I have your three main elements?

13
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:34,000
Okay, I'll do that. Here are my 3 main elements!

14
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Ta-da!

15
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Let's start with number one!

16
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:43,500
The first is ramen, the second is stoicism, and the third is talkativeness.

17
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,500
I see!

18
00:00:50,432 --> 00:00:54,232
Ramen is my favorite food!

19
00:00:54,232 --> 00:00:55,232
Ehhhh...

20
00:00:55,232 --> 00:00:58,832
I really like it, like 3 times a week.

21
00:00:58,832 --> 00:01:00,232
That's a lot!

22
00:01:00,232 --> 00:01:03,132
If I include cup ramen in my diet.

23
00:01:03,132 --> 00:01:05,232
I think it's more like 5 a week.

24
00:01:05,232 --> 00:01:06,232
I see.

25
00:01:06,232 --> 00:01:08,432
Sometimes I eat it twice a day.

26
00:01:08,432 --> 00:01:09,832
That's a lot!

27
00:01:09,832 --> 00:01:10,832
That's right.

28
00:01:10,832 --> 00:01:12,032
No, no, no, no, no, no, no...

29
00:01:12,032 --> 00:01:17,632
By the way, what is the best ramen in Sendai?

30
00:01:17,632 --> 00:01:21,232
There's a ramen shop called "Opechan" that has black mar oil in it.

31
00:01:21,232 --> 00:01:22,032
Oppeshan!

32
00:01:22,032 --> 00:01:25,432
I've been going there since I was in junior high school.

33
00:01:25,432 --> 00:01:28,632
They are also a sponsor of my radio show.

34
00:01:28,632 --> 00:01:30,832
We've even collaborated with them on some ramen dishes.

35
00:01:30,832 --> 00:01:31,632
Is that so?

36
00:01:31,632 --> 00:01:32,432
That's right.

37
00:01:32,432 --> 00:01:35,032
What's that? Not a group? A collaboration as an individual?

38
00:01:35,032 --> 00:01:38,032
No, it's just that I like this Mr. Opechian.

39
00:01:38,032 --> 00:01:39,632
So it's more of an interview.

40
00:01:39,632 --> 00:01:41,432
Well, yes...

41
00:01:41,432 --> 00:01:43,632
I went there for a radio show, and that's when I got the chance.

42
00:01:43,632 --> 00:01:45,632
I became a sponsor of the group.

43
00:01:45,632 --> 00:01:48,632
Oh, you're the one who started it all, aren't you?

44
00:01:48,632 --> 00:01:50,032
I got the job.

45
00:01:50,032 --> 00:01:52,032
That's good.

46
00:01:52,032 --> 00:01:53,232
No, it's good.

47
00:01:53,232 --> 00:01:55,432
I'll leave it to you to imitate me.

48
00:01:55,432 --> 00:01:56,432
Ha-ha-ha-ha.

49
00:01:56,432 --> 00:01:58,432
You're right, I'm in the groove.

50
00:01:58,432 --> 00:01:59,432
Yes, it is.

51
00:01:59,432 --> 00:02:01,032
It's got Tork's logo on it.

52
00:02:01,032 --> 00:02:02,032
That's right.

53
00:02:02,032 --> 00:02:04,432
What's the appeal of ramen?

54
00:02:04,432 --> 00:02:09,432
What? But I think it's fast, cheap, and good.

55
00:02:09,432 --> 00:02:11,232
I see.

56
00:02:11,232 --> 00:02:14,232
Yes, partly because I really like the taste.

57
00:02:14,632 --> 00:02:15,832
But they come out quickly.

58
00:02:15,832 --> 00:02:18,232
And it's easy to go alone.

59
00:02:18,232 --> 00:02:19,232
I see.

60
00:02:19,232 --> 00:02:20,632
It's pretty much a counter.

61
00:02:20,632 --> 00:02:23,632
There are a lot of businessmen around.

62
00:02:23,632 --> 00:02:25,432
but they all come alone.

63
00:02:25,432 --> 00:02:28,832
So I feel less intimidated than when I go to a family restaurant.

64
00:02:28,832 --> 00:02:30,232
I'm not afraid of going alone.

65
00:02:30,232 --> 00:02:33,232
That's why I go alone.

66
00:02:33,232 --> 00:02:35,432
I'm quite impatient.

67
00:02:35,432 --> 00:02:38,032
I'm not the slow course type.

68
00:02:38,032 --> 00:02:40,032
I think I'm an impatient type.

69
00:02:40,032 --> 00:02:42,232
That's why I like conveyor-belt sushi.

70
00:02:42,232 --> 00:02:43,232
It's fast.

71
00:02:43,232 --> 00:02:45,232
I can take whatever I want, eat it, and go home.

72
00:02:45,232 --> 00:02:49,232
I like fast places like that.

73
00:02:52,282 --> 00:02:54,282
Good bye.

74
00:03:00,058 --> 00:03:02,578
Delicious!

75
00:03:03,458 --> 00:03:05,458
Yakanta Idol

76
00:03:26,992 --> 00:03:30,992
Kazumi, if I could, I'd like to be your aunt.

77
00:03:30,992 --> 00:03:32,992
Mayumi

78
00:03:32,992 --> 00:03:34,992
Keisuke

79
00:03:35,992 --> 00:03:37,992
Tempura Hiroshi

80
